  m_text: "Welcome to your 1-week probation!\nNew office. New colleagues.\nYou really
    need this job.\n\nHow to play: \nChoose your avatar.\nStart your shift.\nMove
    with the arrow keys.\nAvoid colleagues. You cannot fight them.\nCollect yellow
    quest items.\nBring them to yellow quest markers.\nGreen items restore resolve.\nBlue
    items increase resolve.\nLeave when the exit is ready."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
